{"4521710": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "GetFunky Deliv'or Die", "steam_appid": 4521710, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GetFunky: Deliv’Or Die</strong> is a narrative adventure game in which you play as crew members aboard the Nexus VI spaceship, forced to deliver a shipment of GetFunky drinks within the allotted time… or risk exploding live on air on KillVision, the local trash TV network.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521710/extras/c322b0f52131456b0b40485307391991.poster.avif?t=1788269974\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521710/extras/c322b0f52131456b0b40485307391991.webm?t=1788269974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521710/extras/c322b0f52131456b0b40485307391991.mp4?t=1788269974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rapidly, your ship begins to suffer major malfunctions !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll need to land regularly and explore sectors of the Red Buffer Zone, a notorious and dangerous region of the galaxy. Solving puzzles and interacting with the eccentric characters you encounter, either solo or cooperatively with your fellow crew members, will be the only way to repair the ship, find fuel, and deliver the cargo on time !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521710/extras/25692ca7ad694f10ed8ef38a66cf9cbb.poster.avif?t=1788269974\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521710/extras/25692ca7ad694f10ed8ef38a66cf9cbb.webm?t=1788269974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521710/extras/25692ca7ad694f10ed8ef38a66cf9cbb.mp4?t=1788269974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Under pressure, every decision matters ! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From crew relationships to the reputation of the Nexus VI, from the limited time to the relentless presence of KillVision’s cameras, everything can spiral out of control !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if time is running out, don’t panic ! You can always throw a punch !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521710/extras/7fd2736221ddd7be8b3e7976dc5a9d85.poster.avif?t=1788269974\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521710/extras/7fd2736221ddd7be8b3e7976dc5a9d85.webm?t=1788269974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521710/extras/7fd2736221ddd7be8b3e7976dc5a9d85.mp4?t=1788269974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repair the ship, uncover the truth behind GetFunky, deliver the cargo, and stay alive… or prepare to explode live in front of millions of viewers. The choice is yours… well, almost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action, exploration, crazy dialogues, and absurdly hilarious situations, all wrapped into a fast-paced, fun, and totally wild experience !</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GetFunky: Deliv’Or Die</strong> is a narrative adventure game in which you play as crew members aboard the Nexus VI spaceship, forced to deliver a shipment of GetFunky drinks within the allotted time… or risk exploding live on air on KillVision, the local trash TV network.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521710/extras/c322b0f52131456b0b40485307391991.poster.avif?t=1788269974\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521710/extras/c322b0f52131456b0b40485307391991.webm?t=1788269974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521710/extras/c322b0f52131456b0b40485307391991.mp4?t=1788269974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rapidly, your ship begins to suffer major malfunctions !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll need to land regularly and explore sectors of the Red Buffer Zone, a notorious and dangerous region of the galaxy. Solving puzzles and interacting with the eccentric characters you encounter, either solo or cooperatively with your fellow crew members, will be the only way to repair the ship, find fuel, and deliver the cargo on time !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521710/extras/25692ca7ad694f10ed8ef38a66cf9cbb.poster.avif?t=1788269974\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521710/extras/25692ca7ad694f10ed8ef38a66cf9cbb.webm?t=1788269974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521710/extras/25692ca7ad694f10ed8ef38a66cf9cbb.mp4?t=1788269974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Under pressure, every decision matters ! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From crew relationships to the reputation of the Nexus VI, from the limited time to the relentless presence of KillVision’s cameras, everything can spiral out of control !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if time is running out, don’t panic ! You can always throw a punch !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521710/extras/7fd2736221ddd7be8b3e7976dc5a9d85.poster.avif?t=1788269974\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521710/extras/7fd2736221ddd7be8b3e7976dc5a9d85.webm?t=1788269974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521710/extras/7fd2736221ddd7be8b3e7976dc5a9d85.mp4?t=1788269974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repair the ship, uncover the truth behind GetFunky, deliver the cargo, and stay alive… or prepare to explode live in front of millions of viewers. The choice is yours… well, almost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action, exploration, crazy dialogues, and absurdly hilarious situations, all wrapped into a fast-paced, fun, and totally wild experience !</p>", "short_description": "Play as the crew of the Nexus VI, forced to deliver a GetFunky shipment in less than 2 hours under the cruel eye of the trash TV KillVision. Broken ship, dangerous stopovers, puzzles and hard choices: cooperate, repair, and survive… or explode live before the entire galaxy.", "supported_languages": "English, French<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521710/3ec3a3c64812e7780cd01c69f3f264dc94ce464f/header.jpg?t=1788269974", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521710/eb66bbd2e624d8d3d444c5b64de344c0c92c3425/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788269974", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstat